      "name": "Emberstone",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "Emberstone 是 GPL-3.0 开源自托管的消防与急救事件记录 Web 应用，按 NFIRS/NEMSIS 标准组织事件表单，提供消防与急救事件的创建、读取、更新与删除，使用 Docker Compose 部署。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/rodneygauna/emberstone",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/rodneygauna/emberstone",
